    # an "H-hi e-everyone… m-my name’s A-Alicia… n-nice t’ m-meet ya…"
    an "大、大家好……我、我叫艾、艾丽西亚……很、很高兴见、见到你……"

# game/script.rpy:4376
translate schinese first_lewd_scene_e8e38ec1:

    # an "..."
    an "……"

# game/script.rpy:4377
