    an "（加油……你、你可以的……就……深呼吸……）"

# game/script.rpy:4379
translate schinese first_lewd_scene_9953e588:

    # an "Hi… e-everyone… my name’s A— A-Alicia. I-It’s… uh… r-really nice t’ meet ya.»"
    an "大、大家好……我叫艾——艾丽西亚。真、真的……呃……很高兴见到你。"

# game/script.rpy:4381
translate schinese first_lewd_scene_ba90f61e:

    # an "(Y-yeah… that’s… a bit better… just a liiittle more…)"
    an "（对、对……这样……好了一点……再来一一点点……）"

# game/script.rpy:4385
translate schinese first_lewd_scene_41fc4e18:

    # an "(whispering) G-go on… keep g-going…"
    an "（低声）继、继续……说、说下去……"

# game/script.rpy:4388
translate schinese first_lewd_scene_6c267a05:

    # i "I still remember what silence was before you~~"
    i "我还记得你出现之前的寂静~~"

