translate schinese first_lewd_scene_6f59b135:

    # mc "(whispering) Maybe I should run while I still can?"
    mc "（低声）我是不是该趁还能逃的时候逃掉？"

# game/script.rpy:4408
translate schinese first_lewd_scene_df03d160:

    # "{b}Her voice would sound clear and mournful, like moonlight over glass — a song more felt than heard."
    "{b}她的声音清澈而哀伤，如月光落在玻璃上——那是一首用心聆听多过用耳聆听的歌。"

# game/script.rpy:4413
translate schinese first_lewd_scene_fcb23ca5:

    # n "Miss Isabella? Your car will arrive in ten minutes. The Master asked me to ensure you are prepared."
